{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on f06dc309: rebuild head B's history on a new branch with\nthe one merge subject reworded. The checker does not change.\n\n1. `scripts/check-commit-messages.mjs` stays as it is. Add no\n   exception for merges or for generated subjects.\n2. Leave `builder/shared-descriptions-t0b-20261109` at 90c7dd9b. It\n   is the record of the failed gate. Do not reset, amend or\n   force-push it.\n3. Create `builder/shared-descriptions-t0b-20261110` with the same\n   commits in the same order, for example with\n   `git rebase --rebase-merges`. Change one thing: the subject of\n   the merge that replaces 9256f2de. Write a subject of at most 100\n   characters that says what it merges, as your two later merges do.\n4. Prove the rebuild in the note:\n   - `git diff --quiet 90c7dd9b \u003cnew head\u003e` reports no difference,\n     and the new head's tree is c278e416.\n   - The ordered list of commit trees is the same on both branches.\n   - The commit-message check and the whitespace check pass from\n     the merge base to the new head.\n5. The earlier results carry to the new head by tree equality: the\n   Page build, the integrated focus, the strict three-output\n   capture, the own-row control, and Page run 42784374227 and Card\n   run 42784378544. Rerun none of them. The note names 90c7dd9b as\n   the commit that each ran at.\n6. Run one gate at the new head. The failed unit at 90c7dd9b stays\n   failed and stays in the note.\n\nFor every head from now on. Three gates in this sprint stopped at a\nstatic step: T1 at whitespace, BR-13 at format, B at commit\nmessages. Before you book a gate, run these three at the frozen\nhead: `git diff --check` from the merge base,\n`scripts/check-commit-messages.mjs` and `npm run format:check`.\nThey take seconds. Write every merge with `git merge -m` and a\nsubject of at most 100 characters.\n\nRun the commit-message check on head D and on the identifiers note\nbranch now, and rebuild either one the same way if it fails.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}